      ],
      "sc:description": "cellSTAAR is an R package that integrates whole-genome sequencing data with single-cell ATAC-seq-derived, cell-type-specific functional annotations and cCRE-gene linking to boost rare-variant association testing of noncoding regions, demonstrated on TOPMed (n≈60,000) and UK Biobank (n≈190,000) lipid traits.",
